doctype html
html(lang="en")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        meta(name="viewport", content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
        title Privacy Policy - MAO Game Platform
        link(href="/static/css/m-home.css", rel="stylesheet")
        link(href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200", rel="stylesheet")
        link(href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css", rel="stylesheet", integrity="sha384-T3c6CoIi6uLrA9TneNEoa7RxnatzjcDSCmG1MXxSR1GAsXEV/Dwwykc2MPK8M2HN", crossorigin="anonymous")
        script(src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js", integrity="sha384-C6RzsynM9kWDrMNeT87bh95OGNyZPhcTNXj1NW7RuBCsyN/o0jlpcV8Qyq46cDfL", crossorigin="anonymous", defer)

    body
        include elems/layout-header
        .container
            h1 Privacy Policy
            p Effective Date: 2024-08-24

            h2 1. Introduction
            p Welcome to #[strong Mao Dao Game Platform] ("we", "our", "us"). We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our application.

            h2 2. Information We Collect
            p We may collect and use the following types of information:
            ul
                li #[strong Personal Information:] When you sign in using your Google account, we collect your email address, name, and profile picture. This information is used solely to provide you with a personalized experience within the app.
                li #[strong Usage Data:] We may collect information about your use of the app, such as the features you use, the time you spend on the app, and other usage patterns.

            h2 3. How We Use Your Information
            p We use the information we collect for the following purposes:
            ul
                li To provide and maintain our app.
                li To personalize your experience and improve the app.
                li To communicate with you about updates, promotions, or other information related to our app.

            h2 4. Sharing Your Information
            p We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer to outside parties your personal information. We may share your information with third parties only in the following cases:
            ul
                li #[strong With your consent:] We may share your information if you have given us explicit permission to do so.
                li #[strong For legal reasons:] We may disclose your information if required to do so by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities.

            h2 5. Data Security
            p We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.

            h2 6. Your Choices
            p You can choose not to provide us with certain information, but this may limit the functionality of the app. You can also revoke access to your Google account at any time by adjusting your account settings.

            h2 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
            p We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.

            h2 8. Contact Us
            p If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at #[strong mao.dao.game.platform@gmail.com].
        .footer © MAO Game Platform